        "text_PfYZBLPuqMbjVPuy": "<p>Quitting bad habits isn’t easy, but Lio simplifies it by focusing on what truly works.</p><p></p><p>Unlike other solutions that rely on nicotine or chemicals, Lio helps you <strong>curb cravings naturally</strong> while preserving the familiar<strong> hand-to-mouth habit</strong>.</p><p></p><p>With Lio, you get a <strong>natural</strong>, <strong>stress-free way</strong> to break free, without side effects.</p><p></p>",
        "padding_top": 0,
